messages.en:
{07 14 00}It was so nice of you to
come. You and {ff 00 00 06}{04 0f 00}{ff 00 00 00}
both, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.
{07 00 00}Thanks! You've both made
this a really special day.{01 00 00 0a 00}
{07 0a 00}I think I'm going to cry!

messages.et:
{07 14 00}Nii kena, et sa tulid.
Sina ja {ff 00 00 06}{04 0f 00}{ff 00 00 00}
mõlemad, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.
{07 00 00}Aitäh! Te tegite sellest
tõesti erilise päeva.{01 00 00 0a 00}
{07 0a 00}Ma vist hakkan nutma!

messages.en:
{07 19 00}As of today, I am exactly
one year older than I
was yesterday, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.
{07 00 00}That's how it works, right?{01 01 00}
{07 17 00}I don't feel a year older.{01 00 00 0f 00}
I{01 00 00 05 00} only feel a day older!

messages.et:
{07 19 00}Tänasest olen ma täpselt
ühe aasta vanem kui
eile, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.
{07 00 00}Nii see käib, eks?{01 01 00}
{07 17 00}Aasta vanem ma ei tunne.{01 00 00 0f 00}
Ainult{01 00 00 05 00} päeva vanem!
